                <mxCell id="Q450ZEcBeJYst12L80hJ-52" value="All layer data block have the same&amp;nbsp;size, so each block can be read without the need to add a termination byte&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Important to note that all layers in `Canvas` are Image struct, which has pointer to heap to the actual image data, so is not possible to just &quot;slap them&quot; into the file" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;strokeWidth=4;fontSize=20;" parent="1" vertex="1">
